## Design (1.2 s total)

| Element | Start | Duration | Motion | Easing |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Heading | 0.00 s | 0.60 s | Fade 0→1, translateY 24→0 px, clip reveal (inset 0 0 100% 0 → 0) | easeOutCubic |
